    "time": "O(R * C * 4 * 3^(L-1))",
    "space": "O(S)",
    "notes": "R x C grid, L the longest word, S the total characters in words (trie size); recursion depth is at most L. The bound is the worst case for the DFS; trie pruning makes typical runs far faster."
